    <preface>
      <p>Identity Verification Services (Consequential Amendments) Act 2023</p>
      <p>No. 116, 2023</p>
      <p>An Act to make amendments consequential on the enactment of the <i>Identity Verification Services Act 2023</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Amendments	3</p>
      <p>Australian Passports Act 2005	3</p>
      <p>Identity Verification Services (Consequential Amendments) Act 2023</p>
      <p>No. 116, 2023</p>
      <p>An Act to make amendments consequential on the enactment of the <i>Identity Verification Services Act 2023</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to 14 December 2023</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
      </formula>
    </preface>
    <body>
      <section eId="sec-1">
        <num>1</num>
        <heading>Short title</heading>
        <content>
          <p>		This Act is the <i>Identity</i><i> Verification </i><i>Services (Consequential Amendments)</i><i> Act 20</i><i>2</i><i>3</i>.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-2">
        <num>2</num>
        <heading>Commencement</heading>
        <subsection eId="sec-2__subsec-1">
          <num>1</num>
          <content>
            <p>Each provision of this Act specified in column 1 of the table commences, or is taken to have commenced, in accordance with column 2 of the table. Any other statement in column 2 has effect according to its terms.</p>
          </content>
          <table>
            <tr>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Column 1</td>
              <td>Column 2</td>
              <td>Column 3</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Provisions</td>
              <td>Commencement</td>
              <td>Date/Details</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>1.  The whole of this Act</td>
              <td>The later of:
(a) the start of the day after this Act receives the Royal Assent; and
(b) the commencement of section 24 of the Identity Verification Services Act 2023.
However, the provisions do not commence at all if the event mentioned in paragraph (b) does not occur.</td>
              <td></td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-1" marker="1">
            <content>
              <p>Note:	This table relates only to the provisions of this Act as originally enacted. It will not be amended to deal with any later amendments of this Act.</p>
            </content>
          </authorialNote>
        </subsection>
        <subsection eId="sec-2__subsec-2">
          <num>2</num>
          <content>
            <p>Any information in column 3 of the table is not part of this Act. Information may be inserted in this column, or information in it may be edited, in any published version of this Act.</p>
          </content>
        </subsection>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-3">
        <num>3</num>
        <heading>Schedules</heading>
        <content>
          <p>Legislation that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
    </body>
    <attachments>
      <attachment>
        <hcontainer name="schedule" eId="schedule-1">
          <num>1</num>
          <heading>Amendments</heading>
          <hcontainer name="amendedAct" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1">
            <heading>Australian Passports Act 2005</heading>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1">
              <num>1</num>
              <heading>Subsection 6(1)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p><b><i>Document Verification Service </i></b>has the same meaning as <b><i>DVS </i></b>has in the <i>Identity Verification Services Act 202</i><i>3</i>.</p>
                  <p><b><i>Face Verification Service</i></b> has the same meaning as <b><i>FVS</i></b><b><i> </i></b>has in the <i>Identity Verification Services Act 202</i><i>3</i>.</p>
                </content>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2">
              <num>2</num>
              <heading>Section 46</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Before “On request,”, insert “(1)”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3">
              <num>3</num>
              <heading>After paragraph 46(d)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3__qstr-1__para-da">
                  <num>da</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>participating in:</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3__qstr-1__para-i">
                  <num>i</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>the Document Verification Service; or</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3__qstr-1__para-ii">
                  <num>ii</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>the Face Verification Service; or</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-3__qstr-1__para-iii">
                  <num>iii</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>any other service specified, or of a kind specified, in <role refersTo="#minister">the Minister</role>’s determination;</p>
                  </content>
                  <content>
                    <p>to share or match information relating to the identity of a person;</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4">
              <num>4</num>
              <heading>At the end of section 46</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-4__qstr-1__subsec-2">
                  <num>2</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>To avoid doubt, information may be provided to the service referred to in paragraph (1)(da) before being disclosed to the person participating in the service.</p>
                  </content>
                  <content>
                    <p>5  Application of amendments</p>
                    <p>The amendments of <ref href="#sec-46">section 46</ref> of the <i>Australian Passports Act 2005</i> made by this Schedule apply in relation to any personal information disclosed after the commencement of this item (whether the information was obtained before or after that commencement).</p>
                  </content>
                </subsection>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5">
              <num>6</num>
              <heading>At the end of Division 1 of Part 5</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <section eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1__sec-46A">
                  <num>46A</num>
                  <heading>Minister may arrange for computer programs to disclose personal information for the purposes of certain identity verification services</heading>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1__sec-46A__subsec-1">
                    <num>1</num>
                    <content>
                      <p><role refersTo="#minister">The Minister</role> may arrange for the use, under <role refersTo="#minister">the Minister</role>’s control, of computer programs in disclosing personal information under paragraph 46(1)(da) to a person participating in:</p>
                    </content>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1__sec-46A__subsec-1__para-a">
                      <num>a</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>the Document Verification Service; or</p>
                      </content>
                    </paragraph>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1__sec-46A__subsec-1__para-b">
                      <num>b</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>the Face Verification Service.</p>
                      </content>
                    </paragraph>
                  </subsection>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-5__qstr-1__sec-46A__subsec-2">
                    <num>2</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>For the purposes of this Act or any legislative instrument made under this Act, <role refersTo="#minister">the Minister</role> is taken to have disclosed personal information in accordance with paragraph 46(1)(da) if the disclosure was made by the operation of a computer program under an arrangement made under subsection (1) of this section.</p>
                    </content>
                    <content>
                      <p>7  Application of amendments</p>
                      <p>Section 46A of the <i>Australian Passports Act 2005</i>, as inserted by this Schedule, applies in relation to any personal information<i> </i>disclosed after the commencement of this item (whether the information was obtained before or after that commencement).</p>
                      <p>[<i>Minister’s second reading speech made in—</i></p>
                      <p><i>House of Representatives on 13 September 2023</i></p>
                      <p><i>Senate on 19 October 2023</i>]</p>
                      <p>(119/23)</p>
                    </content>
                  </subsection>
                </section>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
          </hcontainer>
        </hcontainer>
      </attachment>
    </attachments>
  </act>
